WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.139 --> 00:00:03.139
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie.

00:00:03.139 --> 00:00:05.690
This is going to be my Arrow Episode 7 video.

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:10.840
I’ve also got some new Black Canary pictures
of Laurel in her costume and details on the

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:11.840
Crossover Episode.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:17.820
So let’s talk some Cupid First, who you
may remember as a young mary winchester on

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:18.820
supernatural.

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.630
Careful for spoilers if you’re not caught
up.

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:22.220
Starting with Top 5 moments from the episode.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.449
Number 5 - Flashback Cupid Origin Story

00:00:24.449 --> 00:00:27.880
I think the reason they teased Cupid in the
last episode was because they wanted to open

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.970
with a flashback and didn’t want to have
to add another scene explaining who she was.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:34.530
I’m a big fan of this, it means we can just
get right into the action at the beginning

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:35.660
of episodes.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:40.300
Her origin story on the show is really close
to the one in the comics.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:44.129
Oliver saves her life and she develops an
obsession for him.

00:00:44.129 --> 00:00:48.790
In the comics she was special forces and went
through an experiment that made her super

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:49.790
strong.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:53.519
On the show they made her a former police
officer with no special powers.

00:00:53.519 --> 00:00:59.010
The police training was the reason she had
a background in fighting but in the time since

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:00.710
the season 2 finale when she picked up that
Arrow she’d been doing extra training.

00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:02.000
So that’s why she was able to trade punches
with Oliver.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.589
Number 4 - Team Arrow versus Team Cupid

00:01:04.589 --> 00:01:10.250
Wasn’t it creepy how Cupid and her CI were
like a bizzaro version of Oliver and Felicity.

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:12.570
Looks like them having sex didn’t end well.

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:13.930
Be forewarned Olicity shippers.

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:17.430
Their team Cupid scene was pointed at you.

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:23.420
The Oliver explanation about being alone was
totally a manufactured ‘Felicity Moment’

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:24.909
but I thought it worked.

00:01:24.909 --> 00:01:28.460
She and Oliver are slowly coming to terms
with the reality of their relationship and

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:29.470
what they can and can’t do.

00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:34.630
They haven’t really dealt with it since
episode 1.

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:36.530
The Cupid Fight scene was pretty amazing.

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:40.189
Arrow always has the best fight choreography
so that’s no surprise.

00:01:40.189 --> 00:01:43.320
Favorite stunt was when cupid kicked the grate
loose and they dropped down.

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:47.070
Oliver had to dislocate his own thumb to get
loose from the cuffs.

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:51.290
Everytime I see a character do that I wince.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:56.049
Vin Diesel popped both of his shoulders out
of their sockets during Pitch Black.

00:01:56.049 --> 00:02:00.540
Cupid the character is coming back later this
season.

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:04.300
They explained she’s joining the Suicide
Squad, and replacing Harley Quinn.

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:06.130
That was a nice easter egg.

00:02:06.130 --> 00:02:13.690
I think the reason they did that was because
now that they’re making the suicide squad

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:14.900
movie.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:19.510
They don’t want to add confusion by doing
Harley Quinn on Arrow.

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:21.000
Which kind of sucks.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.430
Number 3 - Oliver and Katana Team Up

00:02:23.430 --> 00:02:26.730
We finally get to see Katana in action and
get some backstory.

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:29.230
Her explanation fits with the comics.

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:33.269
She didn’t go into really great detail but
I expect the show to dedicate an episode to

00:02:33.269 --> 00:02:34.269
that later this season.

00:02:34.269 --> 00:02:35.400
Explain who Maseo and Katana were running
from.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:41.050
In the comics she doesn’t actually become
Katana till after something really crazy happens.

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:44.510
And I don’t think Arrow would have cast
that character if they didn’t intend to

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:45.510
do that.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:50.440
Long story short, she’s a verified badass
with a sword.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:55.110
Expect her to fight other characters who wield
swords.

00:02:55.110 --> 00:03:03.069
Hmmm, didn’t we see a couple of characters
using swords earlier this season…

00:03:03.069 --> 00:03:09.140
I think as she and oliver came back to their
apartment they bonded.

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:11.030
So consider them friends now.

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:15.709
Number 2 - Ray Palmer and Felicity
This is probably agony for Olicity shippers

00:03:15.709 --> 00:03:16.720
but let’s be real.

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:20.879
Ray Palmer isn’t doing anything wrong, he’s
not a bad character but he does have an agenda

00:03:20.879 --> 00:03:22.280
he’s not telling everyone about.

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:25.550
I love how Felicity gets that princess moment.

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:35.560
That look on her face when she got those diamonds
is like the look on Roy’s Face when Oliver

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:37.799
gave him his costume.

00:03:37.799 --> 00:03:41.180
We can all laugh about that for a sec.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:42.890
Points of interest.

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:46.739
The whole subplot about the land ray palmer
is trying to get for the co-generation total

00:03:46.739 --> 00:03:47.739
red herring.

00:03:47.739 --> 00:03:50.790
It contains Dwarf Star Alloy he’s going
to use to make his super suit.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.470
Then there’s his Iron Man Suit.

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:53.940
It’s called an A.T.O.M.

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:54.940
exoskeleton.

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:58.160
So at some point they’ll explain what the
acronym stands for.

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:01.810
But if you listen carefully you can here a
new music cue playing.

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:05.599
That’s going to be his Atom Theme.

00:04:05.599 --> 00:04:08.909
Like Oliver has an Arrow theme, Barry Allen
has a Flash theme.

00:04:08.909 --> 00:04:14.959
His theme music sounded like it had a few
cues from the John Williams superman theme

00:04:14.959 --> 00:04:15.959
too.

00:04:15.959 --> 00:04:19.320
It’s just a coincidence that Ray Palmer’s
colors are the same as Superman’s Colors.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:21.670
But I like the imagery here.

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:30.400
This is really early for them to be teasing
it, so we could get a glimpse of it in the

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:32.040
mid-season finale.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.980
and my Number 1 moment - Captain Boomerang
Flarrow Teaser

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:49.290
Here’s details on what’s going on with
that.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:52.660
Captain Boomerang is the villain of the crossover
episodes.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:05:01.340
They’re going with his Suicide Squad backstory.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:11.450
In the comics the character was formerly part
of the Suicide Squad but he’s Flash villain.

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:13.390
So he fits into both shows really nicely.

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:16.580
Everyone from Team Arrow will go to Central
City in the first part of the crossover on

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:19.140
The Flash to get info on him.

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:36.960
Then in part 2 Team Flash will come to Starling
City to help Team Arrow take him down.

00:05:36.960 --> 00:06:14.300
I don’t want to post more info than necessary
but there’s a whole lot more 

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:24.010
going on with those episodes.

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:28.660
So be sure to watch them.

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:31.510
They’re Episode 8 on both shows.

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:48.720
Arrow is one episode ahead right now but they’ll
take a week off next week so flash can catch

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:49.740
up.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:07:14.250
And they just announced that Arrow and Flash
would do another two part crossover in the

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:30.200
second half of 
the season.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:53.000
They just started planning it, so no info
on what 

00:07:53.000 --> 00:08:01.750
the story will be.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:21.890
Let me know though, what was your favorite
moment and here’s my big question for you

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.250
guys.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:35.200
How badly do you want to punch Thea’s douchbag
DJ in the face.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:43.390
He can be Roy’s new training dummy

